From 5246f7d5c84acfbbbc3da001ae6fff0089f7a937 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vauzi-17 <189964753+Vauzi-17@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 08:23:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 04/18] explorer: Add a Material 3 settings page.

Display Properties of the Material 3 style: a frameless page with a top
app bar, a preview, segmented buttons for the style, the brightness and
the taskbar rows, color swatches and switches, drawn with the Material 3
helpers. Changes apply at once; Done closes the page. The XP and classic
styles keep the Display Properties dialog, both can switch to the other.
